    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d436">

                <pb facs="0424" n="308" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg308"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 811.304M28/72.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Habana</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-04-02">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 2, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>In concluding his message read in the opening of the Congress yesterday
                    afternoon, President Gómez said: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>I do not wish to conclude this message without recording an event that
                            has demonstrated to the entire world the close ties of affection which
                            bind us to <pb facs="0425" n="309" xml:id="pg309"/> American people. I
                            refer to the imposing obsequies and the manifestation of mourning
                            accorded to the remains of the sailors found in the wreck of the
                            battleship <hi rendition="#italic">Maine</hi>, and the removal of the
                            wreck from our jurisdictional waters. Our Government and the American
                            Government were associated in this act and, inspired by a common
                            sentiment, fulfilled a pious duty.</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Beaupré</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
